  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I did a lot of research into this, and I have potentially figured out the cause to this fairly new problem that has cropped up.\nAs you probably know already, Dynamic Bones now jitter when idle, and there's absolutely nothing you can do about it, and it completely ruins avatars that add Dynamic Bones, meaning you pretty much can't use them, or you have to deal with the bug.\nI have contacted the Dynamic Bones programmer with suspicion that it may have been an update with it at some point that has caused it, but it's probably not.\nI can only assume now that it's an oddity in the latest SDK/Unity update, as old avatars don't seem to have that problem.\nI can only hope this is fixed in the physics update. With that said, With that update, I'd like to propose the idea to allow multiple root bones in the new Physics Bones tool, whenever that comes around.\nThanks, and kind regards.",
